DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261119T220000Z
DTEND:20261119T221500Z
SUMMARY:Metro: Midosuji Line\, Namba → Shin-Osaka
DESCRIPTION:Osaka Metro Midosuji Line (M\, red) from Namba M20\, platform for 梅田・新大阪 (Umeda / Shin-Osaka)\, 7 stops to Shin-Osaka M13. Follow signs to the 新幹線 Shinkansen gates.
LOCATION:Shin-Osaka Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Metro: Midosuji Line\, Namba → Shin-Osaka
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-1-1795127760000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261119T223600Z
DTEND:20261120T005700Z
SUMMARY:Shinkansen: Hikari 640\, 07:36 → Mishima 09:57\, reserved
DESCRIPTION:Tokaido Shinkansen Hikari 640 for 東京 Tokyo from Shin-Osaka. Stay on past Shizuoka and get off at 三島 Mishima\, 09:57. Fare ¥7\,150 + reserved seat (est.). The same train as Plan A\, two stops further
LOCATION:Mishima Station South Exit
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Shinkansen: Hikari 640\, 07:36 → Mishima 09:57\, reserved
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-2-1795137600000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261120T012000Z
DTEND:20261120T025000Z
SUMMARY:Bus: Mishima–Kawaguchiko Liner no. 0007\, 10:20 → 11:50
DESCRIPTION:From the Shinkansen gates follow the signs to the South Exit (南口)\, 4 min. 特急 三島・河口湖ライナー (Mishima–Kawaguchiko Liner)\, bus no. 0007\, stop 2 (2番線)\, 10:20. It runs by Lake Yamanaka and Fuji-Q Highland to 河口湖駅 Kawaguchiko Station\, 11:50\, the last stop. Reserve the 6 seats ahead (¥2\,500 on the web\, ¥2\,700 otherwise)\; Suica is not accepted on this bus. At Kawaguchiko\, leave the suitcases at the house if the host agrees\, or in the coin lockers at the station: check-in is from 16:00.
LOCATION:Kawaguchiko Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Bus: Mishima–Kawaguchiko Liner no. 0007\, 10:20 → 11:50
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-3-1795146300000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261120T034500Z
DTEND:20261120T041200Z
SUMMARY:Bus: Red Line bus 12:45 → stop 20\, 13:12
DESCRIPTION:Red Line (河口湖周遊バス レッドライン) from the forecourt of Kawaguchiko Station at 12:45 (every 15 min: :00 :15 :30 :45)\; tap Suica. It runs round the north shore past the Momiji Corridor (stop 17) to the last stop\, stop 20\, 河口湖自然生活館 (Oishi Park)\, 13:12. Sit on the left for the lake.
LOCATION:Oishi Park Kawaguchiko
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Bus: Red Line bus 12:45 → stop 20\, 13:12
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-4-1795150620000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261120T045700Z
DTEND:20261120T052400Z
SUMMARY:Bus: Red Line bus 13:57 Oishi Park → Kawaguchiko Station 14:24
DESCRIPTION:Red Line for 河口湖駅 from stop 20\, 河口湖自然生活館 at 13:57 (or 13:42 if you want the 14:25 train and more time on the deck)\, 27 min to Kawaguchiko Station. 50 minutes before the 15:16 train: coffee by the station\, or Fujiyama Cookie and the Cheesecake Garden about 15 min on foot towards the lake (est.).
LOCATION:Kawaguchiko Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Bus: Red Line bus 13:57 Oishi Park → Kawaguchiko Station 14:24
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-5-1795155360000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261120T061600Z
DTEND:20261120T070500Z
SUMMARY:Train: Fujikyu Line 15:16 → Shimoyoshida 15:30\, then walk and 398 steps
DESCRIPTION:Fujikyu Line (富士急行線) local from Kawaguchiko toward 大月 Otsuki at 15:16\, to 下吉田 Shimoyoshida\, 15:30\; tap Suica. (Earlier: 14:25 → 14:39.) Follow the signs to 新倉山浅間公園 (Arakurayama Sengen Park)\, about 20 min on foot\, then 398 steps up to the deck above the pagoda. Sunset is about 16:33\, to the right of Mt Fuji: the classic lit photo is on arrival\, the silhouette at sunset.
LOCATION:Chureito Pagoda Arakurayama Sengen Park
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Train: Fujikyu Line 15:16 → Shimoyoshida 15:30\, then walk and 398 steps
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-6-1795160700000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261120T074500Z
DTEND:20261120T080000Z
SUMMARY:Walk: Walk down from the park to Honcho Street
DESCRIPTION:Leave the deck by about 16:45 and walk back down towards Shimoyoshida Station\, cross the tracks and continue to 本町通り (Honcho Street)\; the photo spot is the 本町二丁目 (Honcho 2-chome) crossing\, looking south along the street\, with Mt Fuji dark against the evening sky and the shop signs lit. Stay on the pavement. Walking time is an estimate. Leave by 17:10 for the 17:19 train.
LOCATION:Chureito Pagoda Arakurayama Sengen Park
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Walk: Walk down from the park to Honcho Street
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-7-1795162740000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261120T081900Z
DTEND:20261120T083200Z
SUMMARY:Train: Fujikyu Line 17:19 Shimoyoshida → Kawaguchiko 17:32
DESCRIPTION:Fujikyu Line for 河口湖 Kawaguchiko from Shimoyoshida at 17:19 (next 17:54\, 18:38)\, 4 stops\; tap Suica. Collect the suitcases\, check in at Fuga A (2 min on foot)\, then dinner near the station\; many small restaurants close early. Book the Saturday sunrise taxi tonight if you have not.
LOCATION:Kawaguchiko Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Train: Fujikyu Line 17:19 Shimoyoshida → Kawaguchiko 17:32
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-8-1795207500000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261120T204500Z
DTEND:20261120T210000Z
SUMMARY:Taxi: Pre-booked taxi from Fuga A
DESCRIPTION:No bus runs before 9:00. On Friday book a taxi for 05:45 at Fuga A: one 6-seat car if the company has one\, otherwise two taxis. Show the driver: 古賀政男記念公園 (富士河口湖町河口). About 10–15 min and roughly ¥2\,000–2\,500 per car (est.). Also book the pick-up at the Momiji Corridor for 07:35. Sunrise is about 06:25\; the summit turns pink a few minutes before.
LOCATION:Kogamasao Memorial Park Fujikawaguchiko
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Taxi: Pre-booked taxi from Fuga A
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-9-1795211280000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261120T214800Z
DTEND:20261120T220000Z
SUMMARY:Walk: Walk along the lake road to the Momiji Corridor
DESCRIPTION:Walk north-east along the lakeside road\, about 0.8 km (est.)\, to the Momiji Corridor (もみじ回廊) by the Kubota Itchiku Art Museum. The festival stalls open at 9:00\, so it is quiet\; the maples catch the early sun. Follow the map on your phone.
LOCATION:Momiji Corridor Kawaguchiko
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Walk: Walk along the lake road to the Momiji Corridor
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-10-1795214280000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261120T223800Z
DTEND:20261120T225000Z
SUMMARY:Taxi: Pre-booked taxi back to Fuga A
DESCRIPTION:Meet the taxi at 07:35 by the Momiji Corridor car park (or bus stop 17\, 久保田一竹美術館). About 10–15 min to Fuga A (est.). Then a slow breakfast: there is time until 10:00.
LOCATION:Kawaguchiko Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Taxi: Pre-booked taxi back to Fuga A
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-11-1795223400000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261121T011000Z
DTEND:20261121T025500Z
SUMMARY:Bus: Highway bus\, Kawaguchiko Station ~10:10 → Busta Shinjuku ~11:55
DESCRIPTION:Shinjuku–Fuji Five Lakes highway bus (新宿–富士五湖線) for バスタ新宿. Board at stop 3 (3のりば) in the forecourt of Kawaguchiko Station\, about 10:10 (exact time on your booking\; be at the stop 10 min before and show the booking on your phone). One suitcase each goes in the hold. It stops at Fuji-Q Highland\, then runs up the Chuo Expressway: Saturday traffic in leaf season can add 30–60 min. Arrive Busta Shinjuku about 11:55\, at the 3rd-floor arrival deck (新宿駅南口・3階おりば). Buses run about every 10–20 min\; pick the one closest to 10:10 when you book. Direct\, suitcases in the hold. All seats reserved: book 6 seats ahead
LOCATION:Shinjuku Southern Terrace
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Bus: Highway bus\, Kawaguchiko Station ~10:10 → Busta Shinjuku ~11:55
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-12-1795230300000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261121T030500Z
DTEND:20261121T033000Z
SUMMARY:Train: Sagawa counter\, then JR Yamanote Line to Harajuku
DESCRIPTION:On the 3rd floor of Busta Shinjuku\, where the bus arrives\, go into the Tokyo Tourist Information Center: at the Sagawa counter leave the suitcases in storage until the evening (about ¥800–1\,500 a bag for the day\; not in the budget). Same-day delivery to the hotel needs them by 11:00\, which this bus misses. Collect them before 21:00. Then go down to the JR gates below the terminal: JR Yamanote Line\, platform 14\, toward 渋谷・品川 (Shibuya / Shinagawa)\, 2 stops to Harajuku JY19\, ~4 min.
LOCATION:Meiji Jingu
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Train: Sagawa counter\, then JR Yamanote Line to Harajuku
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-13-1795235400000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261121T043000Z
DTEND:20261121T045000Z
SUMMARY:Walk: Walk via Omotesando
DESCRIPTION:Walk down Omotesando towards Aoyama\, turn left on Aoyama-dori to the Aoyama 2-chome corner: the ginkgo avenue runs north from there.
LOCATION:Icho Namiki Jingu Gaien
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Walk: Walk via Omotesando
TRIGGER:-PT15M
