DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261121T091500Z
DTEND:20261121T093000Z
SUMMARY:Walk: Walk west past the West Exit to the twin towers
DESCRIPTION:From the Southern Terrace walk back past the South Exit to the West Exit (西口)\, then along the underground walkway towards 都庁 (Tocho)\, ~15 min. Watch from the Citizens’ Plaza in front of the east wall.
LOCATION:Tokyo Metropolitan Government Building
