SUMMARY:Walk: Walk to the West Exit\, Omoide Yokocho
DESCRIPTION:Walk to the West Exit (西口): Omoide Yokocho runs along the tracks just north of it. Split into two groups of three.
LOCATION:Omoide Yokocho
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Walk: Walk to the West Exit\, Omoide Yokocho
