UID:jp-trip-19-1795262700000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261121T120500Z
DTEND:20261121T123500Z
SUMMARY:Train: JR Yamanote Line\, Shinjuku → Ueno
DESCRIPTION:From Busta go down to the JR New South gates (新南改札). JR Yamanote Line from platform 15\, toward 池袋・上野 (Ikebukuro / Ueno): Shinjuku JY17 → Ueno JY05\, ~25 min\; use the lifts with the suitcases. Leave Ueno by the Iriya Exit (入谷口)\, 2 min to Grids. Check-in closes at 23:00.
LOCATION:Ueno Station
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Train: JR Yamanote Line\, Shinjuku → Ueno
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
