BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-22-1795309500000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261112T153700Z
DTSTART:20261122T010500Z
DTEND:20261122T022500Z
SUMMARY:Train: Keisei Rapid Ltd. Express 10:06 Keisei-Ueno → Keisei-Narita 11:10\, lockers\, walk up Omotesando
DESCRIPTION:Walk to Keisei-Ueno (KS01) by Ueno Park. Rapid Limited Express (快速特急) for 京成成田 Keisei-Narita\, 10:06: no reservation\, tap Suica\, ~64 min to Keisei-Narita (KS40). Not the Skyliner: it skips Keisei-Narita. Keisei changes its timetable on 21 Nov\, so check the 10:06 on the station board. Coin lockers at the station\, then 15 min up Omotesando.
LOCATION:Naritasan Shinshoji
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Train: Keisei Rapid Ltd. Express 10:06 Keisei-Ueno → Keisei-Narita 11:10\, lockers\, walk up Omotesando
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
