SUMMARY:Train: Walk back\, Keisei Narita → Airport Terminal 2·3
DESCRIPTION:Walk back down Omotesando to Keisei-Narita (KS40). Any Keisei train for 成田空港 Narita Airport (about every 20 min)\, 1 stop to 空港第2ビル Airport Terminal 2·3 (KS41)\, ~8 min. Get off here\, not at the last stop.
LOCATION:Narita Airport Terminal 2
